    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The critical power source that failed the community—a power plant component in the Visayas—triggered a cascade. This equipment failure left more than 950 megawatts unavailable, a massive power shortage affecting countless homes. The guardian of the grid's stability then placed the region under a red alert to protect against further collapse.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "who-1",
        "center_kind": "who",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 1
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.95
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The vulnerable energy suppliers left exposed—eleven generators—now faced a significant generation deficit. Prolonged neglect of critical infrastructure, compounded by high seasonal demand, had already strained the system. In response, protective authorities managing the crisis ordered emergency load shedding as an emergency measure to prevent a wider blackout for the community left in the dark.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-1",
          "why-2",
          "how-2"
        ],
        "center": "who-3",
        "center_kind": "who",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 2
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The cascading failure began with the unexpected shutdown of a key generating unit. This grid incident, during a dangerous heatwave stressing the vulnerable system, resulted in a power unavailability affecting the area bearing the brunt of the outage. The power system overseer acted with emergency response, declaring an alert status to manage the crisis and prevent total system collapse.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Caregiver",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-2",
          "how-1"
        ],
